=== Text #4 ===
> [Ar]rangements have been made for a visit to the Dover CGOC at Langdon Battery, Swingate in the afternoon of Wednesday 3rd April. The visit, which is free, will commence promptly at 1430 and last at least 2 hours. There will be[ ample] car parking[ is] available on site however[ car] sharing[ is desirable]. Early booking[ is recommended],[ as] places[ are] limited to 30. Members will be restricted to bringing one guest.
